---
import { ArrowRightIcon, UserIcon } from "@lucide/astro"
---

<section id="about" class="space-y-6">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-x-4">
    <UserIcon size="20" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">about</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-prose space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-pretty">
    <p class="drop-cap">
      I'm a senior frontend engineer based in Berlin. I spend my days building product at Elara Digital GmbH and my
      evenings (and many weekends) maintaining Reactive Resume, a free and open-source resume builder used by millions
      worldwide.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most of what I build is on the web, in TypeScript, with whatever framework piques my interest at the time. This
      blog is a place to share my thoughts and learnings.
    </p>

    <p>
      If any of that resonates,
      <a href="/#contact">
        get in touch
        <ArrowRightIcon size="14" stroke-width="1.5" class="inline" />
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
